OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy across the region
OL,6,Fwith the odd spot of rain possible.
OL,7,FSunny spells developing more widely
OL,8,Fthrough the day but particularly in
OL,9,Fthe south, while some light rain is
OL,10,Fpossible over the Moors and Dales.
OL,11,FBreezy. Temperatures near average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRemaining partly cloudy into
OL,14,Fthe evening with any rain easing.
OL,15,FGenerally cloudy for most areas
OL,16,Fovernight but occasional clearer
OL,17,Fspells are possible. Cool with winds
OL,18,Feasing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
