OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FPartly cloudy to start but
OL,6,Fmostly dry. Cloud building at times,
OL,7,Falthough the odd brighter spell is
OL,8,Fpossible. Light winds with near
OL,9,Faverage temperatures.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FHigh
OL,12,Fpressure continues to dominate, often
OL,13,Fbringing cloudy conditions with light
OL,14,Frain at times but some clearer spells
OL,15,Ftoo. Gentle winds. Temperatures remain
OL,16,Faround normal for the time of year.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
